  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Most of the time a vote kicks happens in a large world nobody votes on it since everyone's separated and it says nothing (Since you require the majority of the server to vote \"Yes\" and usually the majority of the server isn't in the same place to witness whoever is being kicked most people ignore it)\n\nLike vote kicks for \"Mic Spam\" \"Inappropriate behavior\" \"Crasher\" \"Underage\" stuff like that so it shows up when someone is being vote kicked?\n\nEspecially for crashers kicking them quick is important since blocking them quickly only protects you and they can easily sneak up on people and crash from behind before they have a chance to block",
